&lt;li&gt;Lead, coach and grow a specialized team of Android engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the team’s technical vision and roadmap in partnership with Client Platforms and cross-functional product teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive platform modernization that helps product teams adopt modern client architectures and build high-quality experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve client stability, health metrics, browser compatibility, runtime frameworks and critical dependency currency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish clear operating rhythms for planning, two-week sprints, risk management and monthly stakeholder updates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire, onboard and develop engineers, creating an inclusive, high-performing team with clear expectations and growth opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI to accelerate engineering workflows and modernization while applying judgment and verification to maintain code quality, security and reliability.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience in engineering, including 2+ years of experience in engineering management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical judgment grounded in mobile Android engineering, e.g. Kotlin, Compose, and modern architectures like MVVM.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience partnering with Senior/Staff engineers to build high impact roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building platform capabilities that improve the productivity and effectiveness of product engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and collaboration skills, and experience aligning priorities across teams and driving delivery through ambiguity and competing stakeholder needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to use AI to improve speed and quality in day-to-day workflows, with a strong practice of validating AI-assisted work and maintaining ownership of final outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, a related field or equivalent experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This job posting is for an open vacancy. Please note that the company utilizes artificial intelligence to screen applicants for the positions.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
