&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This role will need to be in the office for in-person collaboration&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;1-2 times per week and therefore needs to be in a commutable distance from one of the following offices: Palo&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Alto(preferred) or San Francisco&lt;/li&gt;
